	(text "CHASSIS-MOUNTED. 180 A port: ETI gBat (30 kA at L/R 1 ms) 200 A 1000 V DC in each pole, derated 136 A (fuses in the INLET air path,\nPD3: terminals / fuse bases only, creepage to PE >= 16.0 mm IIIa, IC-18/IC-21).\nFIRMWARE CURRENT LIMIT (D-020): 180/180/180/172/164/155/146/136 A at inlet 25/30/35/40/45/50/55/60 C (port_spec port_current_limit_vs_inlet_C)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 43.64 0)
		(effects
